  "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333399;\">REPORT on THREE DAYS FDP ON ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE, MACHINE LEARNING &amp; DEEP LEARNING IN THE DATA REVOLUTION ERA: PROGRESS &amp; APPLICATIONS</span></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #333399;\">\nOrganized by\nDepartment of Computer Science &amp; Engineering\nand Department of CSE-AIML</span></h4>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #333399;\">About FDP</span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The aim of this Faculty Development Program (FDP) is to enrich participants' understanding of the latest advancements in AI, ML, and DL, along with their emerging applications. Esteemed experts from prestigious academic institutions and leading industries will be invited to share their insights and experiences in research. This FDP is designed to inspire beginners to cultivate an interest in AI, ML, and DL, while also supporting researchers in advancing their work in these domains.</p>\n\n<h5 style=\"text-align: right;\"></h5>\n<h5></h5>\n[caption id=\"attachment_21316\" align=\"aligncenter\" width=\"76\"]<a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/CSE-FDP-Report-2025.pdf\"><img class=\"wp-image-21316\" src=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/—Pngtree—download-icon_3581467.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\" /></a> <strong>DOWNLOAD REPORT</strong>[/caption]\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h5>",
